OL,3,AAI gold rush draws crypto firms away
OL,4,Afrom Bitcoin
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow many are pivoting to AI and signing
OL,7,Fdeals with companies such as Anthropic
OL,8,F- who are spending billions of dollars
OL,9,Fon the infrastructure needed to keep up
OL,10,Fin the AI race.
